- Fix booking ID prefix (STU-/GLM- instead of undefined BK-)
- Fix searchBookings to accept email/phone/query from frontend (was causing 'Invalid PIN' error on track page)
- Fix client emails: now sent for ALL booking types (studio, glam, bridal, special)
- Personalised email templates per booking type with rich context
- Add 2-hour reminder email template + sendReminder backend action
- Full cart system on Shop page (no login, localStorage session)
  - Add to cart, quantity controls, remove items
  - Cart drawer, checkout form (name/phone/delivery type)
  - Sends order via WhatsApp + saves to backend
- New shop_orders Firestore collection + adminGetShopOrders/Update/Delete actions
- Admin: new Orders tab with filter/sort/delete for shop orders
- Training services section on homepage
- Footer: TikTok icon @beccastouch, phone 08023274274, exact address, Ola hyperlinked
- siteConfig: updated phone, whatsapp, TikTok, address
- saveShopOrder backend action + admin email notification
